{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StylebookTreeItem",
  "tagName": "main",
  "$elements": [
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-icon.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-action-button.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-dot.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-tree-item.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-tree.json"
    }
  ],
  "state": {
    "names": ["folder", "file", "dots-three-vertical"]
  },
  "style": {
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
    "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
    "background": "var(--jx-bg)",
    "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
    "minHeight": "100vh",
    "& > h1": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-lg)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)"
    },
    "& > h2": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "margin": "var(--jx-space-6) 0 var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& > p": {
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-dim)",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)",
      "maxWidth": "72ch"
    },
    "& jx-tree": {
      "maxWidth": "280px",
      "border": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--jx-bg-panel)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-1) 0"
    },
    "& [part=\"badge\"]": {
      "$description": "A consumer's mark, slotted into `icon`. It is the consumer's box and the consumer's declarations: the row generates none of its own for the three zones, so a badge, a chip and a pin all sit on the row's one flex line.",
      "flex": "none",
      "maxWidth": "12ch",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "var(--jx-tag)",
      "color": "var(--jx-accent-fg)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h1",
      "textContent": "jx-tree-item"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "One row, and a row is all it is. Its level, its position among its siblings and how many siblings it has are PROPS, because a windowed tree holds a slice: a row that counted its own siblings would count the drawn ones and tell a reader a directory holds four files when it holds eight hundred."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "h2",
      "textContent": "Levels, twisty and leaf"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "An empty expanded means a LEAF: no aria-expanded, no chevron, and the box the chevron would occupy is kept so every name lines up. The indent is --jx-tree-indent times one less than the level."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tree",
      "attributes": {
        "label": "Row states"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "open",
            "label": "An open branch",
            "level": "1",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "3",
            "expanded": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "shut",
            "label": "A closed branch",
            "level": "2",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "2",
            "expanded": "false"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "leaf",
            "label": "A leaf",
            "level": "3",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "h2",
      "textContent": "Selected, disabled and cut"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "aria-selected is written only when the row IS selected: a false on every row is what tells assistive technology a tree supports multiple selection, and that answer belongs on the tree. A cut row is faded and says nothing to a reader, because the host announces the move through its own live region."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tree",
      "attributes": {
        "label": "Selection states"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "picked",
            "label": "Selected",
            "level": "1",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "3",
            "selected": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "off",
            "label": "Disabled",
            "level": "1",
            "posinset": "2",
            "setsize": "3",
            "disabled": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "lifted",
            "label": "Cut, waiting for a paste",
            "level": "1",
            "posinset": "3",
            "setsize": "3",
            "cut": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "h2",
      "textContent": "The three slots and the grip"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "icon draws before the name, status and actions after it. The division is the CLICK: status holds a mark about the row and clicking it selects the row, while actions holds a control and the click stops there. The grip is the pointer's grab affordance for the drag island and never a second way to move a row — the keyboard path is cut and paste."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tree",
      "attributes": {
        "label": "Slotted rows"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "src",
            "label": "src",
            "level": "1",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "2",
            "expanded": "true"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-icon",
              "attributes": {
                "slot": "icon"
              },
              "$props": {
                "name": "folder"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tree-item",
          "attributes": {
            "value": "src/hero",
            "label": "Hero",
            "level": "2",
            "posinset": "1",
            "setsize": "1",
            "grip": ""
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "badge",
                "slot": "icon"
              },
              "textContent": "section"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-dot",
              "attributes": {
                "slot": "status",
                "aria-hidden": "true"
              },
              "$props": {
                "tone": "warning"
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
              "attributes": {
                "slot": "actions"
              },
              "$props": {
                "label": "More actions",
                "hint": "More actions",
                "icon": "dots-three-vertical",
                "haspopup": "menu",
                "size": "sm",
                "quiet": true,
                "tabindex": "-1"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
